    "background_story": "Sebastian was a renowned pastry chef known for his exquisite creations. He spent years perfecting his craft, working in some of the world's top kitchens. But it wasn't until he opened his own bakery that he truly felt fulfilled. The sweet aroma of freshly baked croissants and the smile on a customer's face when they took a bite brought him immense joy. Sebastian was particularly pleased when his bakery was awarded the prestigious Golden Whisk award, a testament to his hard work and dedication. He beamed with pride as he accepted the award, knowing that his passion had brought happiness to so many people. As he returned to his bakery, he was greeted with a hero's welcome, his team and customers celebrating his well-deserved success.",
